1
00:00:00,125 --> 00:00:00,965
The first thing she did

2
00:00:00,965 --> 00:00:01,949
was to call me

3
00:00:01,949 --> 00:00:04,688
and thank me for the contribution

4
00:00:04,688 --> 00:00:05,639
I had in her life.

5
00:00:05,729 --> 00:00:06,709
Hi, I'm Syaheer.

6
00:00:06,709 --> 00:00:10,069
I've been a MAP Coach since 2011,

7
00:00:10,069 --> 00:00:11,144
which is about 15 years ago.

8
00:00:11,244 --> 00:00:13,223
Hi, I'm Nur Azyyati.

9
00:00:13,223 --> 00:00:15,315
Teaching has always been my passion.

10
00:00:15,425 --> 00:00:16,645
I used to be an educator,

11
00:00:16,645 --> 00:00:19,325
so I've moved out to IT

12
00:00:19,325 --> 00:00:20,452
in corporate roles.

13
00:00:20,452 --> 00:00:22,689
And this is my way of giving back.

14
00:00:22,694 --> 00:00:24,434
I want to help those, especially students

15
00:00:24,434 --> 00:00:27,094
who need more guidance and support.

16
00:00:27,199 --> 00:00:29,459
I get to interact with a lot of students

17
00:00:29,459 --> 00:00:31,698
and I've touched many lives.

18
00:00:31,748 --> 00:00:33,508
It's fulfilling to see students

19
00:00:33,508 --> 00:00:35,828
who initially struggle,

20
00:00:35,828 --> 00:00:37,512
doubt themselves or lack motivation

21
00:00:37,512 --> 00:00:38,592
slowly begin to believe

22
00:00:38,592 --> 00:00:39,640
in their own abilities.

23
00:00:39,640 --> 00:00:41,675
Back in 2024, I was teaching

24
00:00:41,675 --> 00:00:43,213
a Primary 6 Foundation student.

25
00:00:43,213 --> 00:00:44,766
She has to retake her PSLE.

26
00:00:44,766 --> 00:00:45,686
She told me that

27
00:00:45,686 --> 00:00:47,281
this is the last time.

28
00:00:47,281 --> 00:00:49,076
She worked really, really hard.

29
00:00:49,076 --> 00:00:49,917
She actually passed

30
00:00:49,917 --> 00:00:51,318
her Math Foundation

31
00:00:51,318 --> 00:00:52,354
for the first time.

32
00:00:52,354 --> 00:00:53,874
I hope my students walk away

33
00:00:53,874 --> 00:00:55,894
with greater confidence in themselves

34
00:00:55,894 --> 00:00:57,334
and believe that they are capable

35
00:00:57,334 --> 00:00:59,293
of achieving more than they think.

36
00:00:59,353 --> 00:01:01,683
As the head coaches and coaches

37
00:01:01,683 --> 00:01:03,343
come from many different backgrounds,

38
00:01:03,343 --> 00:01:04,665
not strictly just education.

39
00:01:04,700 --> 00:01:06,740
You don't have to be a perfect educator

40
00:01:06,740 --> 00:01:08,575
because I think every human makes mistakes.

41
00:01:08,575 --> 00:01:10,575
As long as you are passionate,

42
00:01:10,575 --> 00:01:11,215
you have the patience

43
00:01:11,215 --> 00:01:13,235
and you are willing to have

44
00:01:13,235 --> 00:01:14,675
an impact on a child's life.

45
00:01:14,705 --> 00:01:16,339
If you are already thinking about it,

46
00:01:16,339 --> 00:01:17,060
sign up.
